direction: down
title: "C23 SFUN admission refusal, source roots and native outcomes"
"Native callback source" -> "Source owner borrow": "pin actual RC/procedure/native argument lifetime without Scheme allocation"
"Source owner borrow" -> "Entry admission decision": "stage-tagged refusal before marker and converter"
"Entry admission decision" -> "Native outcome adapter": "refusal is not a conversion handler request"
"Entry admission decision" -> "Registered guard root": "accepted; initialized source/root slots; exact attempt"
"Registered guard root" -> "Marker allocation": "source ACK only after scanner-visible destination"
"Marker allocation" -> "Generated SFUN call": "marker success prerequisite; failure skips inner loop"
"Generated SFUN call" -> "Conversion recovery": "only converter-origin errors; call rejection bypasses recovery"
"Generated SFUN call" -> "Stable outer landing": "escaped marker/guard/root custody"
"Conversion recovery" -> "Stable outer landing": "nested admission refusal is terminal; no closed-domain loop"
"Stable outer landing" -> "Marker and guard closure": "retain until safe native-use closure and GC authorization"
"Marker and guard closure" -> "Native outcome adapter": "exactly-once cleanup before final native delivery"
